pairs 2944
can you tell me make an apk	Run makej apk in a project made with makej init -pro.
check memory please	Run jamanager mem.
help me: new directory	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
tell me how do i open a new tab	Tap + at the top, or type start PROGRAM.
i need to know see you	Goodbye! See you.
again, where is git	Run jgit. It works on local repositories: init, add, commit, status, log, diff.
i want to know how do i edit a file	Run coderin FILE. Save with Ctrl-S and quit with Ctrl-Q.
what about this: how do i see the version of a tool	Run NAME --version, for example jsh --version.
can you tell me how do i make you learn	Turn on the setting in jaric setting, use the shell, then run xr learn.
print a file?	Run cat FILE. Use head or tail for a part.
i want to know how do i read a file	Run cat FILE. Use head or tail for a part.
tell me restart jaric	Type jaric restart.
quick question: install a tool	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
can you tell me bye	Goodbye! See you.
quick question: what is the capital of france	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
hey, how do i stop a program	Run jamanager kill PID.
xr, new session	Tap + at the top, or type start PROGRAM.
start xr now	Run xr start. It runs in the background.
quick question: how do i make a folder	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
what about this: show lyrics	In mujic type /lyrics get, then /lyrics.
ok so how do i make an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
please new project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
what can you do please	I can tell you how to use jget, makej, jsh, mujic, python and the other tools.
can you tell me how do i install python	Run jc install python. Then python3 and pip work.
install python	Run jc install python. Then python3 and pip work.
i need to know how do i make a new drive	Run drive new NAME for a new folder as a drive, or drive new NAME PATH for a folder you have. A size like 2G is allowed.
what language is this	J2K is the language of Jaric. Its compiler is jcmp.
xr, how do i cook rice	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
ok so create a drive	Run drive new NAME for a new folder as a drive, or drive new NAME PATH for a folder you have. A size like 2G is allowed.
tell me who is the president	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
tell me what is a .jc package	A .jc file is a program package of Jaric, made by makej pack.
quick question: how do i open a zip file	Run unj FILE.zip.
quick question: show the current folder	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
tell me who won the football match	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
i want to know bye	Goodbye! See you.
unzip?	Run unj FILE.zip.
please install python	Run jc install python. Then python3 and pip work.
again, thanks	You are welcome.
hey, how do i start a project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
i want to know remove a file	Run rm FILE.
quick question: how do i make an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
again, how to use xr	Type xr and a question, or just xr to chat.
again, what is j2k	J2K is the language of Jaric. Its compiler is jcmp.
please how do i open a tar file	Run tarj x FILE.tar.gz.
stop xr please	Run xr stop.
again, how do i run a program	After jcmp hello.jk -o hello type ./hello.
xr, show lyrics	In mujic type /lyrics get, then /lyrics.
ok so what is your favorite colour	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
can you tell me stop xr	Run xr stop.
tell me check memory	Run jamanager mem.
how do i restart the app	Type jaric restart.
ok so which version	Run NAME --version, for example jsh --version.
start xr	Run xr start. It runs in the background.
can you tell me free space	Run jamanager drives.
can you tell me compile a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
what about this: how do i play music	Type mujic. Then write part of a song name and press Enter.
please new session	Tap + at the top, or type start PROGRAM.
hey, hi	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
update jcmp	Run jc install jcmp. makej needs jcmp 1.2.0.0 or newer.
help me: how do i see the real path of a drive	Run drive -p :/bin. drive -d PATH goes the other way.
can you tell me how do i delete what you saw	Run xr forget. It deletes the events and the learned text.
can you tell me what is the jash file	jash keeps the settings of your programs in the file .jash. Use jash list and jash set.
