i need to know how do i download and run a script	jget -jsh URL. Only use addresses you trust.
again, how do i change the font size	In jaric setting choose font size, or pinch the screen.
i need to know add a program	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
tell me how do i stop a program	Run jamanager kill PID.
ok so who are you	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
what about this: what time is it in tokyo	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
help me: what is the shell	jsh is the shell of Jaric. Type help inside it.
what about this: the app closes when i swipe it	Run jaric keepalive and allow the app to run in the background. The wake lock button is in the notification.
how do i talk to you?	Type xr and a question, or just xr to chat.
again, hello	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
help me: what time is it in tokyo	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
tell me new directory	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
how do i install python?	Run jc install python. Then python3 and pip work.
i need to know what is f: and 0:	f:/ is your home, 0:/ is the storage of the phone, r:/ is the root. drive shows them.
help me: open the editor	Run coderin FILE. Save with Ctrl-S and quit with Ctrl-Q.
again, how do you do	I am fine, thank you. What do you want to do?
i want to know how do i sort songs into folders	In mujic type /mv NAME FOLDER.
i want to know open the editor	Run coderin FILE. Save with Ctrl-S and quit with Ctrl-Q.
what about this: how do i read a video file	Run jvp4 info FILE.
video info now	Run jvp4 info FILE.
can you tell me bigger letters	In jaric setting choose font size, or pinch the screen.
again, where are your files	In the folder .neuron in your home. Run xr where to see it.
xr, what is f: and 0:	f:/ is your home, 0:/ is the storage of the phone, r:/ is the root. drive shows them.
hey, change colours	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
i need to know how do i find a word in files	Run grep -n WORD FILE.
xr, how do i play music	Type mujic. Then write part of a song name and press Enter.
get a new tool please	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
quick question: import songs	In mujic type /import PATH, or put the files in the folder music.
i need to know thank you	You are welcome.
quick question: go to a folder	Run cd FOLDER. cd :/ goes home, cd 0:/ to the phone storage.
i need to know delete a tool	Run jc unstall NAME. jsh and jget cannot be removed.
quick question: write me a poem	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
again, list a folder	Run dir. Use dir -a to see hidden ones.
i need to know how do i make an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
rename something?	Run mv FROM TO. It also renames.
install yt-dlp please	Run jc install python yt-dlp. Use it only for what you may download.
quick question: where is git	Run jgit. It works on local repositories: init, add, commit, status, log, diff.
can you tell me what is the real path	Run drive -p :/bin. drive -d PATH goes the other way.
help me: play a game with me	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
hey, what folder am i in	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
quick question: what is a jc file	A .jc file is a program package of Jaric, made by makej pack.
hey, how do i see running programs	Run jamanager ps, or jamanager top.
xr, erase a file	Run rm FILE.
what about this: how do i build the app	Run makej apk in a project made with makej init -pro.
