help me: install a tool	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
please play video	Run jaric video FILE.
again, good morning	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
what is the kernel please	The Jaric kernel is being built step by step; it runs in jemu first. See Jaric/os/kernel.
can you tell me do you have an os	The Jaric kernel is being built step by step; it runs in jemu first. See Jaric/os/kernel.
please how do i start the assistant	Run xr start. It runs in the background.
help me: play video	Run jaric video FILE.
ok so how do i change the theme	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
xr, see you	Goodbye! See you.
i want to know what can you do	I can tell you how to use jget, makej, jsh, mujic, python and the other tools.
quick question: good morning	Hi! I am xaiorin, your helper. Ask me about the tools.
tell me who are you	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
can you tell me new directory	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
xr, what is the kernel	The Jaric kernel is being built step by step; it runs in jemu first. See Jaric/os/kernel.
again, how far is the moon	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
quick question: get new versions	Run jc update. jc update -n only shows what would change.
what about this: free space	Run jamanager drives.
help me: how do i change the theme	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
tell me what is the real path	Run drive -p :/bin. drive -d PATH goes the other way.
what about this: what is j2k	J2K is the language of Jaric. Its compiler is jcmp.
start a game please	Run makej init -game and then makej run.
how do i see the disk	Run jamanager drives.
i want to know create a folder	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
again, play a song	Type mujic. Then write part of a song name and press Enter.
