ok so what is the real path	Run drive -p :/bin. drive -d PATH goes the other way.
help me: how do i keep the app alive	Run jaric keepalive and allow the app to run in the background. The wake lock button is in the notification.
how do i sort songs into folders please	In mujic type /mv NAME FOLDER.
can you tell me what folder am i in	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
xr, how do i stop a program	Run jamanager kill PID.
help me: change colours	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
i need to know create a drive	Run drive new NAME for a new folder as a drive, or drive new NAME PATH for a folder you have. A size like 2G is allowed.
ok so how do i build a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
again, open settings	Type jaric setting. Use the arrows and Enter.
how do i talk to you	Type xr and a question, or just xr to chat.
i need to know xr learn	Turn on the setting in jaric setting, use the shell, then run xr learn.
ok so how do i install pip	pip comes with the tool python: jc install python.
train an ai now	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
