hey, how do i make an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
can you tell me download a file	Run jget URL. It shows a progress bar.
help me: how do i open a zip file	Run unj FILE.zip.
please make an apk	Run makej apk in a project made with makej init -pro.
