tell me tell me a joke	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
again, how do i build a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
ok so what is a jw file	A .jw file is a model of neuron, the whole AI in one file.
can you tell me untar	Run tarj x FILE.tar.gz.
download a file	Run jget URL. It shows a progress bar.
hey, how do i update everything	Run jc update. jc update -n only shows what would change.
how do i start a project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
can you tell me how do i change the font size	In jaric setting choose font size, or pinch the screen.
i need to know play video	Run jaric video FILE.
how do i delete a folder please	Run rm -r FOLDER. It deletes the folder and everything in it.
rename something now	Run mv FROM TO. It also renames.
can you tell me what is the shell	jsh is the shell of Jaric. Type help inside it.
help me: how do i make an ai	Run makej init -ai, edit data/chat.txt, then makej train.
i want to know your name	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
xr, play a game with me	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
quick question: rename a file	Run mv FROM TO. It also renames.
quick question: show a file	Run cat FILE. Use head or tail for a part.
tell me import songs	In mujic type /import PATH, or put the files in the folder music.
quick question: how do i make a zip file	Run zipj out.zip FOLDER.
how do i update the compiler now	Run jc install jcmp. makej needs jcmp 1.2.0.0 or newer.
ok so how much memory is free	Run jamanager mem.
tell me what folder am i in	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
again, run my program	After jcmp hello.jk -o hello type ./hello.
unzip	Run unj FILE.zip.
what is the jash file	jash keeps the settings of your programs in the file .jash. Use jash list and jash set.
please what are drives	f:/ is your home, 0:/ is the storage of the phone, r:/ is the root. drive shows them.
can you tell me how do i start a project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
install python?	Run jc install python. Then python3 and pip work.
get a new tool?	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
again, where is the model	In the folder .neuron in your home. Run xr where to see it.
help me: where is the model	In the folder .neuron in your home. Run xr where to see it.
list a folder	Run dir. Use dir -a to see hidden ones.
quick question: make an apk	Run makej apk in a project made with makej init -pro.
how do i delete a folder	Run rm -r FOLDER. It deletes the folder and everything in it.
do you have an os?	The Jaric kernel is being built step by step; it runs in jemu first. See Jaric/os/kernel.
ok so get a new tool	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
quick question: delete a directory	Run rm -r FOLDER. It deletes the folder and everything in it.
ok so how far is the moon	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
quick question: who are you	I am xaiorin, xr for short, a small model that runs on your phone.
how do i copy a file?	Run cp FROM TO. Use cp -r for a folder.
please what is the price of gold	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
i need to know how do i change the theme	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
help me: what is jw	A .jw file is a model of neuron, the whole AI in one file.
ok so how do i keep the app alive	Run jaric keepalive and allow the app to run in the background. The wake lock button is in the notification.
i want to know how do i build a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
create a folder please	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
