what about this: how do i cook rice	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
hey, how do i make a new drive	Run drive new NAME for a new folder as a drive, or drive new NAME PATH for a folder you have. A size like 2G is allowed.
what folder am i in?	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
i want to know what is j2k	J2K is the language of Jaric. Its compiler is jcmp.
again, close a running program	Run jamanager kill PID.
