i need to know what is jc	jc installs and runs the programs of Jaric: jc install NAME, jc update, jc unstall NAME, jc list.
i want to know how do i open a new tab	Tap + at the top, or type start PROGRAM.
quick question: remove a file	Run rm FILE.
tell me how do i install a tool	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
i need to know who invented the telephone	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
i need to know where is git	Run jgit. It works on local repositories: init, add, commit, status, log, diff.
i need to know how do i delete a folder	Run rm -r FOLDER. It deletes the folder and everything in it.
again, where am i	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
