again, what is your favorite colour	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
show the current folder	Run pwd. pwd -p shows the real path.
tell me how do i build a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
help me: add a program	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
what about this: what is a .jc package	A .jc file is a program package of Jaric, made by makej pack.
help me: how do i see the disk	Run jamanager drives.
what about this: erase a file	Run rm FILE.
what about this: how do i download a file	Run jget URL. It shows a progress bar.
help me: how do i read a file	Run cat FILE. Use head or tail for a part.
quick question: what are drives	f:/ is your home, 0:/ is the storage of the phone, r:/ is the root. drive shows them.
open settings now	Type jaric setting. Use the arrows and Enter.
which version	Run NAME --version, for example jsh --version.
again, how do i update jget	Run jc update. It updates jsh and every tool that has a newer version.
quick question: how do i see the lyrics	In mujic type /lyrics get, then /lyrics.
again, write me a poem	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
how do i stop the assistant	Run xr stop.
ok so show lyrics	In mujic type /lyrics get, then /lyrics.
help me: open settings	Type jaric setting. Use the arrows and Enter.
ok so unzip	Run unj FILE.zip.
remove a folder	Run rm -r FOLDER. It deletes the folder and everything in it.
what is your favorite colour	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
tell me create a folder	Run mkdir NAME. mkdir -p makes the parents too.
change colours please	Type jaric theme NAME, for example jaric theme amber.
quick question: how do i remove a tool	Run jc unstall NAME. jsh and jget cannot be removed.
how do i make a new drive?	Run drive new NAME for a new folder as a drive, or drive new NAME PATH for a folder you have. A size like 2G is allowed.
please who won the football match	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
show a file?	Run cat FILE. Use head or tail for a part.
help me: where are your files	In the folder .neuron in your home. Run xr where to see it.
quick question: what is a jw file	A .jw file is a model of neuron, the whole AI in one file.
can you tell me help	I can tell you how to use jget, makej, jsh, mujic, python and the other tools.
quick question: how do i build the app	Run makej apk in a project made with makej init -pro.
how do i install a tool?	Use jc install NAME, for example jc install mujic. jc list shows what there is.
tell me how do i keep the app alive	Run jaric keepalive and allow the app to run in the background. The wake lock button is in the notification.
again, how do i install pip	pip comes with the tool python: jc install python.
i want to know how do i open a tar file	Run tarj x FILE.tar.gz.
how do i make you learn?	Turn on the setting in jaric setting, use the shell, then run xr learn.
hey, what is this app	Jaric is a terminal app with its own shell, tools and a language.
tell me how do i see the version of a tool	Run NAME --version, for example jsh --version.
what about this: what is jsh	jsh is the shell of Jaric. Type help inside it.
how do i install yt-dlp please	Run jc install python yt-dlp. Use it only for what you may download.
can you tell me how do i stop the assistant	Run xr stop.
ok so who won the football match	I do not know that. Ask me about the tools of Jaric (for example: how do I install a tool).
where is git please	Run jgit. It works on local repositories: init, add, commit, status, log, diff.
again, bigger letters	In jaric setting choose font size, or pinch the screen.
please how do i see the version of a tool	Run NAME --version, for example jsh --version.
please how do i build a program	Write hello.jk and run jcmp hello.jk -o hello.
how do i see the real path of a drive please	Run drive -p :/bin. drive -d PATH goes the other way.
what about this: how do i start a project	Make a folder and run makej init -pro NAME.
can you tell me update my tools	Run jc update. jc update -n only shows what would change.
please free space	Run jamanager drives.
what is makej?	makej is the build tool. makej builds, makej run runs, makej -j builds on many cores.
hey, how do i use git	Run jgit. It works on local repositories: init, add, commit, status, log, diff.
what about this: bye	Goodbye! See you.
ok so how do i get free music	In mujic type /get and choose a free song.
help me: goodbye	Goodbye! See you.
hey, search text	Run grep -n WORD FILE.
